  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
    "raw": "Instructions",
    "value": "介绍"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
    "raw": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.",
    "value": "通过点击网格上的图标来选择一项研究。\n您可以通过按住鼠标左键拖动来导航网格。\n\n- 屏幕顶部最左侧的按钮用于打开可供选择的研究树列表。\n\n- 第二个按钮用于打开非隐藏的研究选项列表。点击列表中显示的研究项，可将视图居中定位到该研究的图标上。再次点击该按钮可隐藏列表。\n\n- 第三个按钮用于将视图居中定位到科技树的中心，或者当前选中的研究项目上。\n\n- 最后一个按钮用于切换 ^orange;低质量模式^reset;。此模式下，界面将直接跳转到目标位置，而非通过平移动画（搜索列表或居中按钮触发的动画）移动。此外，在主屏幕上的拖动导航操作，仅在释放鼠标按钮后才会更新视图。建议在此模式下使用搜索列表功能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Training",
    "value": "基础训练"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n得益于在守护团学院的四年学习，您所受的训练为你提供了基本的生存技能，确保在发生坠机等意外时能够长时间维持生命。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/electronicsbasic/0",
    "raw": "Electronics",
    "value": "电学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/electronicsbasic/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've taught yourself some basic electronics and can now make a variety of rudimentary wired machinery at the ^orange;Electronics Center.^reset;",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您自学了一些基础电子知识，现在可以在^orange;电子设备制造机^reset;处制作各种简单的有线机械设备了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/solar1/0",
    "raw": "Solar Power",
    "value": "太阳能"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/solar1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe free energy of stars is now within your reach with your understanding of solar technology. You can now build solar panels at your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n随着你对太阳能技术的掌握，恒星的免费能量如今已触手可及。现在，您可以在^orange;电子设备制造机^reset; 处建造太阳能电池板。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/solar2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Solar Cells",
    "value": "改进太阳能单元"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/solar2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've learned to use graphene to enhance your solar panels, allowing you to build bigger and more efficient solar arrays.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已经学会使用石墨烯来增强太阳能板，从而能够建造更大、更高效的太阳能阵列。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/solar3/0",
    "raw": "Peerless Solar Cells",
    "value": "绝世太阳能单元"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/solar3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nBy combining nanofibre and Quietus metals, you can create incredibly potent solar towers which harvest vast amounts of renewable energy.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n通过结合纳米纤维与寂灭金属，您可以制造出效能惊人的太阳能塔，从而收集大量的可再生能源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/hydraulicdynamo/0",
    "raw": "Steam Power",
    "value": "蒸汽动力"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/hydraulicdynamo/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've mastered the primitive-but-useful art of steam power. You can build a hydraulic piston that boils water using 'hot' fuels like lava or core fragments to generate early power.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已掌握了原始却实用的蒸汽动力技艺。能够建造液压活塞，利用熔岩或核心碎片等“高温”燃料煮沸水，从而产生早期的动力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/windpower/0",
    "raw": "Wind Turbines",
    "value": "风力涡轮机"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/windpower/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWith access to hardier metals like Titanium, you've developed a durable wind turbine which will generate lots of renewable energy in the right environment.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n得益于钛等更坚固金属的应用，您已研发出一种耐用的风力涡轮机，在适宜环境中能产生大量可再生能源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combustion/0",
    "raw": "Combustion Engines",
    "value": "内燃机"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combustion/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've improved upon your fossil-fuel-burner design. With a Combustion Engine, you can generate more power than an Alternator using a wider array of fuel types.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您对化石燃料燃烧器的设计进行了改进。通过采用内燃机，您可以利用更多种类的燃料，产生比交流发电机更强大的动力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/electricfurnace/0",
    "raw": "Powered Smelting",
    "value": "动力冶炼"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/electricfurnace/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned to use electrically-generated heat to smelt materials automatically. The ^orange;Electric Furnace^reset; can only process ^gray;common^reset; and ^green;uncommon^reset; ores, but it's great for getting extra materials from ores and blocks.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已学会利用电力产生的热量自动熔炼材料。^orange;电炉^reset;虽只能处理^gray;普通^reset;与^green;非凡^reset;矿石，但它能从矿石和方块中高效提取额外资源，非常实用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/blastfurnace/0",
    "raw": "Industrial Smelting",
    "value": "工业冶炼"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/blastfurnace/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nExperimentation with heat-resistant alloys have lead to your creation of a powerful Blast Furnace which can efficiently smelt ^cyan;rare^reset; ores, and many materials which regular furnaces can't handle.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n通过对耐热合金的反复试验，你成功打造出一座强大的高炉，它能高效熔炼^cyan;稀有^reset;矿石，以及许多普通熔炉无法处理的材料。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/arcsmelter/0",
    "raw": "Arc Smelting",
    "value": "电弧冶炼"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/arcsmelter/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nUsing your newfound quantum knowledge, you've designed an incredibly powerful electric furnace that smelts even more efficiently and quickly than a blast furnace, but can also perform quantum conversions by pressurizing its contents to levels that surpass gas giants.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n凭借您新掌握的量子知识，你设计出了一台无比强大的电炉。它不仅比高炉熔炼得更高效、更迅速，还能通过将内部物质加压至超越气态巨行星的水平，实现量子转化。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fission/0",
    "raw": "Nuclear Power",
    "value": "核能"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fission/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've gotten a hang of nuclear fission, and can now build Fission Reactors that not only provide tons of power, but also generate useful fission by-products. Just mind the radiation.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已经掌握了核裂变的诀窍，现在可以建造裂变反应堆了。它们不仅能提供大量能源，还能产生有用的裂变副产品。不过要记得小心辐射。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fusion/0",
    "raw": "Basic Fusion",
    "value": "基本熔炼"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fusion/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've done it! You've determined how to create stable fusion reactions! This is an efficient producer of energy, but ^red;requires coolant such as water or liquid nitrogen^reset; or you risk potentially fatal explosion.\nCan be fueled with hydrogen isotopes such as Hydrogen, Helium 3 and Tritium.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您成功了！您已经掌握了如何实现稳定的核聚变反应！这是一种高效的能源生产方式，但^red;需要水或液氮等冷却剂^reset;，否则可能引发致命的爆炸风险。  \n可以使用氢同位素如氢、氦-3和氚作为燃料。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fusion2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Fusion",
    "value": "高级聚变"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fusion2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWhy stop at -basic- fusion when you can create something far more appealing? While expensive, the ^orange;Large Fusion Reactor^reset; is well worth its weight for the power it can produce using hydrogen isotopes. It still ^red;requires coolant such as water or liquid nitrogen^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n既然能创造出更具吸引力的成果，为何要止步于基础的聚变？^orange;大型聚变反应堆^reset;虽然造价高昂，但其利用氢同位素产生的巨大能量完全物超所值。不过，它仍^red;需要水或液氮等冷却剂^reset;来维持运行。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/quantumpower/0",
    "raw": "Quantum Nucleonics",
    "value": "量子核子学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/quantumpower/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nGenerating electricity from quantum mechanics is something very few people have done, but you can count yourself among them with your new Quantum Reactor. Capable of burning both traditional and esoteric fuels, it generates unfathomably large amounts of power.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n利用量子力学发电是鲜有人涉足的领域，但凭借你的新型量子反应堆，你已跻身其中。它能燃烧传统与神秘燃料，产生难以想象的巨大能量。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/quantumextractor/0",
    "raw": "Quantum Processing",
    "value": "量子处理"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/quantumextractor/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nNot satisfied with traditional extraction machines, you've improved on the design with quantum mechanics. Quantum Extractors not only work faster than ever, but produce twice as much from their extractions.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n对传统提取设备感到不满，您运用量子力学原理对其进行了革新。量子萃取器不仅运行速度空前提升，其提取产量更是翻倍增长。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery1/0",
    "raw": "Silicon Batteries",
    "value": "硅基电池"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nUsing silicon, you've learned to create simple solid-state batteries at your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;- a big step up from junky old lead-acid ones.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n在^orange;电子设备制造机^reset;，你已学会利用硅材料制造简单的固态电池，这相比老旧笨重的铅酸电池而言，是一次巨大的进步。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Batteries",
    "value": "改进电池"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've improved your skills building batteries with silicon, and can now create batteries that hold much more charge than before.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您在硅基电池制造方面的技术已有所提升，现在能够制造出比以往储电量更大的电池。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery3/0",
    "raw": "Protocite Batteries",
    "value": "原体电池"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nUsing Protocite's amazing ability to store and channel energy, you've designed a new kind of battery that is better than silicon in every way.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n借助原体石卓越的能量储存与传导能力，您成功设计出一种新型电池，其各方面性能均超越硅基电池。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery4/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Batteries",
    "value": "高级电池"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nCombining Quantum technology and Quietus metals, you have developed a bizarre sort of battery that stores energy almost like a living creature. This comes with even better storage capacity.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n结合量子技术与寂灭金属，您研发出一种奇特的电池，其储能方式近乎生物体，且拥有更卓越的存储能力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery5a/0",
    "raw": "Hydrogen Batteries",
    "value": "氢电池"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/battery5a/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nLiquid Metallic Hydrogen is such a potent energy medium that it blows any solid-state battery out of the water. With it, you've designed what may well be the best battery in the galaxy.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n液态金属氢作为一种极其强大的能量介质，其性能远超任何固态电池。凭借它，您设计出的电池堪称宇宙中的顶尖之作。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/centrifuge1/0",
    "raw": "Industrial Centrifuging",
    "value": "工业级离心"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/centrifuge1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nWith Tungsten, you can now build a big, bulky centrifuge that more efficiently processes liquids and can also receive external attachments to jar honey. Build one at your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n使用钨，您现在可以建造一台大型、坚固的离心机，它能更高效地处理液体，并且还能接收外部附件来罐装蜂蜜。请在您的^orange;电子设备制造机^reset;处建造一台。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/centrifuge2/0",
    "raw": "Laboratory Centrifuging",
    "value": "实验室离心"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/centrifuge2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've developed a sleek new centrifuge that is better at its job than before thanks to the power of Protocite processing.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已研发出一种新型的高效离心机，其性能较以往更为卓越，这要归功于原体石处理的力量。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sifter2/0",
    "raw": "Powered Sifting",
    "value": "电力筛选"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sifter2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nHaving improved upon your Sifter design, you can now harvest the hidden treasures of blocks much more efficiently. You can also create a Rock Crusher, which breaks up hard materials like cobblestone and conglomerate instead of sands and silts.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n经过对筛分机设计的改进，您现在能更高效地采集方块中的隐藏宝藏。此外，您还可以制造碎岩机，用于粉碎鹅卵石和砾岩等坚硬材料，而不再局限于沙土和淤泥。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/centrifuge3/0",
    "raw": "Isotope Processing",
    "value": "同位素处理"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/centrifuge3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nWith AI technology, you've designed a centrifuge that is so efficient and capable that it can even process radioactive isotopes into exciting new forms.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n借助人工智能技术，您设计出了一款高效强大的离心机，它甚至能将放射性同位素处理成令人兴奋的全新形态。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/itemnetwork/0",
    "raw": "Item Utilities",
    "value": "物品实用化"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/itemnetwork/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nUsing Item Networks, you can automate a huge number of processes and improve your quality of life dramatically. Researching Item Utilities will give you access to a laundry list of useful utility objects at your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n借助物品网络，您可以自动化大量流程，显著提升生活品质。研究物品实用化后，您将在^orange;电子设备制造机^reset;解锁一系列实用的工具物品清单。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/worker2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Producers",
    "value": "改进产线"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/worker2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned to upgrade your copper pumps and quarries into iron versions, which work more quickly.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已经学会了将铜制水泵和挖掘器升级为铁制版本，它们的工作效率更高。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/worker3/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Producers",
    "value": "高级产线"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/worker3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've learned to upgrade your iron pumps and quarries into titanium versions, which work more quickly still.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已经学会了将铁质泵和挖掘器升级为钛合金版本，它们的运作速度更加迅捷。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/worker4/0",
    "raw": "Peerless Producers",
    "value": "绝世产线"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/worker4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've learned to upgrade your titanium pumps and quarries into Densinium versions, which work extremely quickly.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您已经学会了将钛制泵和挖掘器升级为坚密钢版本，它们的运行速度极快。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/wiringadv/0",
    "raw": "Technical Wiring",
    "value": "技术布线"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/wiringadv/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a crafting table for creating logic gates, sensors, traps and other large-scale wiring objects.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您设计了一个用于制作逻辑门、传感器、陷阱及其他大型布线物品的工作台。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/turrets/0",
